      "message": "Unfortunately this isn\u0027t true on our [master-art thin manifest](https://android.googlesource.com/platform/manifest/+/refs/heads/master-art/default.xml), which essentially leaves out the platform parts. A lot of the logic here is about using the prebuilts to make up for the things we cannot use from there - that\u0027s the whole reason for extracting apex\u0027es etc.\n\nI suspect it\u0027s necessary to move this stuff into a script instead. I suggest a new script `art/tools/build-art.sh` rather than putting it directly into `buildbot-build.sh`, because those make targets are used from [other places too](https://cs.android.com/search?q\u003dbuild-art(-host%7C-target)%5Cb\u0026ss\u003dandroid%2Fplatform%2Fsuperproject%2Fmain).",
